The build scripts generate AMD (Xilinx) IP cores, including the DMA/Bridge
Subsystem for PCI Express (XDMA) and the AXI BRAM Controller, from settings in
hw/scripts/ip.tcl. Those cores are not part of this repository and are subject
to AMD's own license terms. The host DMA driver is AMD's dma_ip_drivers,
obtained separately under its own license.
